# ── Kept out of the public repository ───────────────────────────────────────
# These stay on disk and keep working locally; they are simply not part of what
# a reader of this project should have to wade through.

# Agent tooling and vendored third-party skills (1.6 MB, not ours)
.claude/
.agents/

# Internal working documents: pivot rationale, build journal, pitch rehearsal.
# Written in Spanish for the author, not for a reader of the codebase.
CLAUDE.md
PIVOT.md
PROGRESS.md
EXPLICACION.md
AGENTS.md

